ters the final weeks with a commanding lead.\n\nPolling throughout the fall has been remarkably consistent: Quinnipiac, Siena, and even Republican-leaning Susquehanna all show Shapiro up by roughly 18 to 27 points among likely voters. The October debate did not appear to shift the race. All major race raters call it Solid or Safe D, and prediction markets price Shapiro's win probability around 98 percent. Garrity's campaign has emphasized her rural roots and affordability themes, but there is little evidence of movement in her direction.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9929, "margin": 15.66}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9928, "margin": 16.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9978, "margin": 19.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9956, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9951, "margin": 17.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.995, "margin": 17.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.995, "margin": 17.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9972, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9889, "margin": 17.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9946, "margin": 18.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.995, "margin": 17.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9958, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9964, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9963, "margin": 18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9934, "margin": 17.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9971, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9988, "margin": 22.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9983, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9993, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9994, "margin": 22.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.999, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9988, "margin": 22.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9986, "margin": 22.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.9994, "margin": 22.0}]}